153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CraftCraft is made by a small fully indie studio who made Death and Taxes.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Become a jeweler or a smith in a quaint port town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Create a moth / elf / cat character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ✧ Meet a lot of different folks and impact their lives. Your choices matter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Have a cute owlcat as a pet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Relax and craft! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Make <i>shiny</i> stuff. ✧ ⋆ ˙ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Make even MORE <i>shiny</i> stuff. ⋆ ˙ ✧ + *  ˙ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ✧ Make less <i>shiny</i> and more <strong>ominous</strong> stuff.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Includes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Full voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Short branching story spanning 11 in game days. About 5-8 hours to finish the game once. (+ a non-story endless mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ✧ Replayability (multiple backgrounds with unique characters tied to it, some random scavangables and multiple endings). <br> <br>✧ Original soundtrack using real folk instruments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Completely unique crafting simulation </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 2.1</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 3.3</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation"],"developers":["Placeholder Gameworks","Pineapple Works"],"publishers":["Placeholder Gameworks","Hawthorn Games"],"release_date":"May 29, 2025"}